# Deploy on every code change

After you finish editing this repo, follow `.cursor/skills/git-push-and-deploy/SKILL.md`.

every time change of code do a git push and deploy

PUSH AND deploy gh pages

Create a `cursor/<short-description>` branch, commit only the related files, fast-forward `main`, and `git push origin main` in the same turn. Pushing `main` deploys https://palramai.in (GitHub Pages). Skip only when there is nothing to commit. Do not force-push `main`.
